cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this knowledge graph, please cite it as below and name the release (kg/manifest.json) you read."
title: "AgriHub Genomic Knowledge Base: disease resistance of wheat, soybean and chickpea for Central India"
type: dataset
repository-code: "https://github.com/KASVIK26/gkb-v1"
authors:
  - name: "AgriHub project team"
abstract: >-
  A scored, evidence-backed knowledge graph of crop varieties, their disease reactions, resistance genes and genome regions, pathotype surveys,
  weather triggers and management advisories for wheat, soybean and chickpea in Central India. Every claim cites a source with a verbatim quote;
  confidence tiers A-D are computed. No claim has yet been reviewed by a person.
keywords: [wheat, soybean, chickpea, disease resistance, knowledge graph, India]
